WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Let's look at how to set up a campaign without an end date, which can help customers discover

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.560
your products all year round.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.680
When you're creating your campaign, you'll find the start and end date right in the campaign

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.680
settings.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:16.160
By default, your campaign won't have an end date, so all you have to do is leave it alone.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.120
Now, if you do accidentally set an end date, it's an easy fix.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.600
Click on the date, and right above the calendar that appears, you'll see no end date.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.600
Click here to reset it.
